`WITH SECURITY_ENFORCED` was removed as of API 61.0, so at API 67.0 it no longer compiles. I need to replace it with `WITH USER_MODE`, which enforces the same object/field-level security but throws `System.QueryException` (wrapping the access violation) at execution time, matching the documented behavior that `searchNotes` throws when the user lacks field access.

